            If you want a generator that can use most of a 50 amp outlet, the Westinghouse WGen11500DFc is the one to buy: 47.9 amps at 240V, remote start and a CO shutoff. The Westinghouse WGen9500DF and DuroMax XP12000EH are the value picks at about 40 amps per leg, the DuroMax XP13000EH adds headroom for a modest step up, and the Champion 201417 is the quiet inverter option if you can live with its 37.5 amp rating.
          </p>
